  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "When viewing the Home tab of the iOS VRChat launcher, if you scroll down to the Hot Worlds section, worlds with longer names can overflow the shadow gradient at the bottom of the world tile. When the world image itself is also white or otherwise a lighter color, this can result in poor contrast between the text and the image. For comparison Android seems to have smaller world title text (as far as I can tell) and the shadow extends higher when the text wraps, so it doesn't have this issue.\n\nTested on an iPhone 14.",
